# Caching Strategy

## Objective

Cache to reduce expensive, repeated work  -  never cache without understanding staleness and invalidation.

## Good Candidates

Expensive computation, stable config, repeated lookups, static reference data.

## Avoid

Caching rapidly changing data without invalidation strategy; caching errors; unbounded caches.

## Cross-links

`performance.mdc`, `context-caching.mdc`, `architecture.mdc`.

## Golden Rule

A cache you cannot invalidate is a bug waiting to happen.